 "OCT 用近紅外光取代超音波，解析度約 10–20 微米，是 IVUS 的十倍，可看清易破裂斑塊的薄纖維帽、每一根支架鋼絲是否貼壁、內膜剝離與鈣化厚度。代價是光穿不透紅血球與厚斑塊：回拉時必須注射顯影劑把血液沖開，深度只有 1–2 毫米，常看不到外彈性膜。動畫約 36 秒。": "OCT uses near-infrared light instead of ultrasound. Its 10–20 µm resolution is about ten times finer than IVUS, showing the thin fibrous cap of a vulnerable plaque, whether every stent strut is apposed, dissections and calcium thickness. The trade-off: light cannot pass through red cells or thick plaque, so contrast must be injected to flush the blood during the pullback, and penetration is only 1–2 mm — the EEM is often not visible. The animation lasts about 36 seconds.",
