 "右冠狀動脈中段被血栓完全塞住，遠端沒有血流（TIMI 0），下壁心肌缺血、心電圖 ST 上升。": "The mid right coronary artery is completely blocked by thrombus with no distal flow (TIMI 0); the inferior myocardium is ischaemic and the ECG shows ST elevation.",
 "右冠狀動脈供應右心室與左心室下壁；中段被血栓塞住時，會造成下壁心肌梗塞。心導管經手腕或鼠蹊部動脈進入，依序放入導引導管、導絲、吸栓導管、氣球與支架，恢復血流。動畫約 27 秒，可點下方步驟跳轉或重播。": "The right coronary artery supplies the right ventricle and the inferior wall of the left ventricle; a thrombus blocking the mid segment causes an inferior myocardial infarction. The catheter enters through the radial or femoral artery, and a guiding catheter, guidewire, aspiration catheter, balloon and stent are placed in turn to restore flow. The animation lasts about 27 seconds; click a step below to jump or replay.",
 "右冠狀動脈急性阻塞，如何打通血管": "How to reopen an acutely blocked right coronary artery",
 "右心室流出道心室頻脈（RVOT VT）": "Right ventricular outflow tract VT (RVOT VT)",
 "右心房內的大迴圈繞著三尖瓣環逆時針轉：沿心房中隔往上、沿右心房側壁往下，再通過下腔靜脈與三尖瓣之間的峽部（CTI，紅色標示）。心房每分鐘約 300 次，房室結通常 2:1 下傳，所以心室約每分鐘 150 下；II、III、aVF 導程可見鋸齒狀 F 波。電燒目標：在 CTI 燒一條線，阻斷迴圈。": "A large circuit in the right atrium runs counter-clockwise around the tricuspid annulus: up the septum, down the lateral wall, then through the isthmus between the IVC and the tricuspid valve (CTI, marked red). The atria beat at about 300/min and the AV node usually conducts 2:1, so the ventricular rate is about 150/min; leads II, III and aVF show saw-tooth F waves. Ablation target: a line across the CTI to block the circuit.",
 "吸栓": "Aspiration",
