 "嚴重時 RA 波形接近 RV 波形（心室化），RA 平均壓與 RVEDP 都上升。": "In severe TR the RA tracing approaches the RV tracing (\"ventricularisation\"); mean RA pressure and RVEDP both rise.",
 "回拉完成。下方縱切圖標出最小管腔面積（MLA）與最小支架面積（MSA）的位置；點縱切圖可跳到任一位置並自動量測。支架擴張不足（MSA ÷ 參考管腔面積 < 80%）通常需以高壓非順應性氣球再擴張；近端左前降支 MLA < 4 mm² 常被視為有意義狹窄的參考值。": "Pullback complete. The longitudinal view marks the minimal lumen area (MLA) and the minimal stent area (MSA); tap it to jump to any frame and measure automatically. Stent under-expansion (MSA ÷ reference lumen area < 80%) usually calls for post-dilation with a high-pressure non-compliant balloon; in the proximal LAD an MLA < 4 mm² is often used as a threshold for a significant stenosis.",
 "回拉完成。下方縱切圖標出最小管腔面積（MLA）與最小支架面積（MSA）的位置；點縱切圖可跳到任一位置並自動量測。支架擴張不足（MSA ÷ 參考管腔面積 < 80%）通常需以高壓非順應性氣球再擴張；鈣化弧＞180°、厚度＞0.5 mm 時要先處理鈣化。": "Pullback complete. The longitudinal view marks the minimal lumen area (MLA) and the minimal stent area (MSA); tap it to jump to any frame and measure automatically. Stent under-expansion (MSA ÷ reference lumen area < 80%) usually calls for post-dilation with a high-pressure non-compliant balloon; calcium with an arc > 180° and thickness > 0.5 mm should be modified first.",
 "大 v 波不是 MR 專有：左心房順應性差、VSD、MS、心衰竭也會出現；急性重度 MR 的 v 波最明顯，慢性 MR 合併大而順應的左心房反而可能不明顯。": "A large v wave is not specific to MR: a stiff left atrium, VSD, MS and heart failure can also cause it. It is most striking in acute severe MR, and may be modest in chronic MR with a large, compliant left atrium.",
 "大多數副傳導路徑位在二尖瓣環上，這裡採逆行主動脈途徑：電燒導管從股動脈經主動脈逆行而上，穿過主動脈瓣進入左心室，再彎到二尖瓣環下方的副傳導路徑放電燒灼。": "Most accessory pathways lie on the mitral annulus, so here the retrograde aortic approach is used: the ablation catheter goes up from the femoral artery through the aorta, crosses the aortic valve into the left ventricle and curls up under the mitral annulus to ablate the accessory pathway.",
 "導引導管": "Guiding catheter",
