 "血管內超音波 · 橫切面": "Intravascular ultrasound · cross-section",
 "血管內超音波（IVUS）：從血管裡面看斑塊": "Intravascular ultrasound (IVUS): seeing plaque from inside the artery",
 "血管攝影只看得到管腔的影子；血管內超音波把 60 MHz 的超音波探頭送進冠狀動脈，從裡面切出一圈一圈的橫切面，可看到血管壁三層結構、斑塊的量與性質、鈣化，以及支架有沒有撐開、貼壁。超音波穿透深，量得到外彈性膜（EEM）與斑塊負荷，但鈣化後方會被聲影遮住。動畫約 36 秒。": "Angiography only shows the silhouette of the lumen. IVUS puts a 60 MHz ultrasound probe inside the coronary artery and images it slice by slice from within: the three-layer wall, the amount and type of plaque, calcium, and whether a stent is fully expanded and apposed. Ultrasound penetrates deeply, so the external elastic membrane (EEM) and plaque burden can be measured, but calcium casts an acoustic shadow behind it. The animation lasts about 36 seconds.",
 "計算值": "Calculated",
 "跨肺壓差（TPG）與 PVR 上升（PVR > 2 WU），是區分前、後微血管性的關鍵。": "A raised transpulmonary gradient (TPG) and PVR (> 2 WU) is the key to separating precapillary from postcapillary disease.",
 "軟斑塊（纖維脂肪斑塊）：偏心、回音比外膜暗的低回音斑塊，後方沒有聲影；斑塊負荷高，但管腔還不算太窄。": "Soft (fibro-fatty) plaque: an eccentric, hypoechoic plaque darker than the adventitia with no shadowing behind it; the plaque burden is high although the lumen is not yet very narrow.",
 "軟斑塊（纖維脂肪斑塊）：訊號中等、較不均勻的偏心斑塊；深處訊號較快衰減，所以通常看不到外彈性膜。": "Soft (fibro-fatty) plaque: an eccentric plaque with intermediate, less homogeneous signal; the signal fades quickly with depth, so the EEM is usually not visible.",
 "輕度": "Mild",
 "近端": "Proximal",
 "這不是迴旋，而是右心室流出道一個局部病灶（亮點）自己反覆快速放電，電流從流出道往下擴散到整個心室。因為不走正常傳導束，QRS 寬，呈左束支阻斷型、下軸（II、III、aVF 正向）。竇房結仍照自己的速度發出 P 波，與 QRS 無關（房室分離）。多見於結構正常的心臟。電燒目標：流出道的最早活化點。": "This is not re-entry: a focus in the right ventricular outflow tract (bright spot) fires rapidly by itself and the impulse spreads down from the outflow tract through the ventricles. Because it bypasses the normal conduction system the QRS is wide, with LBBB morphology and an inferior axis (positive in II, III, aVF). The sinus node keeps firing P waves at its own rate, unrelated to the QRS (AV dissociation). It usually occurs in structurally normal hearts. Ablation target: the site of earliest activation in the outflow tract.",
 "這段左前降支同時有瀰漫鈣化、軟斑塊、易破裂斑塊、一支沒有完全撐開的舊支架，以及支架遠端邊緣的內膜剝離。導引導管已在左主幹開口，先把導絲穿過所有病灶，送到左前降支遠端。": "This LAD segment contains diffuse calcification, soft plaque, a vulnerable plaque, an older under-expanded stent and a dissection at the stent's distal edge. The guiding catheter is engaged in the left main ostium; first the guidewire is passed across all the lesions to the distal LAD.",
 "遠端": "Distal",
 "重度": "Severe",
 "長期可造成後微血管性（postcapillary）肺高壓：PA 壓上升，但 PVR 多半正常。": "Over time it causes postcapillary pulmonary hypertension: PA pressure rises but PVR is usually normal.",
 "雙腔靜脈": "Bicaval",
 "電燒完成：異常電路被打斷（深紅點為燒灼位置），恢復正常竇律。可再選其他心律比較。": "Ablation complete: the abnormal circuit is broken (dark red dots mark the lesions) and sinus rhythm is restored. Choose another rhythm to compare.",
 "電燒導管經下腔靜脈、右心房、三尖瓣進入右心室，到流出道的最早活化點放電燒灼。": "The ablation catheter passes from the IVC through the right atrium and tricuspid valve into the right ventricle and ablates the earliest activation site in the outflow tract.",
 "電燒導管經股靜脈、下腔靜脈進入右心房，到冠狀竇口與三尖瓣環之間的慢徑路放電燒灼。": "The ablation catheter enters the right atrium via the femoral vein and IVC and delivers energy to the slow pathway between the coronary sinus ostium and the tricuspid annulus.",
 "電燒導管與環狀定位導管（Lasso）一起從股靜脈經下腔靜脈進入右心房，穿過心房中隔到左心房；另一支冠狀竇導管從頸部經上腔靜脈放進冠狀竇當參考。Lasso 放在肺靜脈口記錄電位，電燒導管先沿左側兩條肺靜脈外圍逐點繞燒一大圈，再換到右側繞第二圈（肺靜脈隔離），把觸發源隔開。": "The ablation catheter and a circular mapping catheter (Lasso) come up together from the femoral vein through the IVC into the right atrium and cross the atrial septum into the left atrium; a separate coronary-sinus catheter is placed from the neck via the SVC as a reference. With the Lasso recording at the pulmonary-vein ostium, the ablation catheter burns point by point in one wide circle around the left pair of veins, then a second circle around the right pair (pulmonary vein isolation), cutting the triggers off.",
